{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bEM1klarT71793281395.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日劇《別班》第二季被指辱華，與劇集推出聯乘商品的三麗鷗SANRIO宣布終止合作並致歉。外交部指，該劇再次暴露日本國內有勢力，企圖通過文化產品散播仇華情緒。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆指出︰「我們注意到有關報道。這部電視劇再次暴露出日本國內始終存在一股勢力，企圖通過文化產品醜化、抹黑中國，散播仇華情緒，應當引起國際社會和日本國內有識之士的警惕。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:01:19.310245+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:21.869408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:21.869408+00:00","content_hash":"7540ac1635a641f90544b0abef2f8ca9acbd5dc0e91b00325139350e5723848e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}